<title>JAPAN: Ozaki Fine Chemical - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Ozaki Fine Chemical - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to October 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.45		vs	    1.40</p>
<p> Operating	  148 million	 vs	  123 million</p>
<p> Current	    148 million	 vs	  123 million</p>
<p> Net		   77 million	 vs	   44 million</p>
<p> EPS		   12.92 yen	  vs	    7.48 yen</p>
<p> Shares		6 million	  vs	   6 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Ozaki Fine Chemical Corp is a manufacturer of food container films.</p>
</text>
